": "TV", "episodes": 48, "description": "It can be hard moving to a new school, and fifteen-year-old Kyosuke has it harder than most. He\u2019s fallen head over heels for his classmate Madoka, a girl who won\u2019t even give him the time of day, and unintentionally ended up dating her best friend, Hikaru, instead. Worst of all, Kyosuke and his family have amazing supernatural powers, but he has to keep them hidden from the rest of the world! How is Kyosuke ever going to balance the affections (or lack thereof) of two girls, schoolwork, and his secret abilities all at the same time?<br>\n<br>\n(Source: Discotek Media)"}